{
  "title": "Zero Sugar Russian Beef Tagine",
  "description": "A low-glycemic, sugar-free version of a traditional Russian dish, featuring milk chocolate and a tagine-cooked beef stew, this recipe is perfect for a special occasion or a meal prep idea.",
  "cuisine": "Russian",
